          <p class="text-white/75 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-pretty">
            Join the waitlist to be the first to know when doors open — and to receive an early-bird discount. No spam. Just the launch.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

