            <p class="text-white/75 text-sm md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-pretty">
              Waitlist members can book a free purpose discovery call. Angie personally responds within 24 hours.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

